Package: libgbax
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Game Boy Advance emulator (common library for GBAx)
 GBAx is a new emulator for running Game Boy Advance games. It aims to be faster
 and more accurate than many existing Game Boy Advance emulators, as well as
 adding features that other emulators lack.
 .
 This package provides the common library for GBAx.
 .
 Game Boy Advance is a registered trademark of Nintendo of America Inc. GBAx is
 not affiliated with or endorsed by any of the companies mentioned.

