Package: libretro-gbax
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Libretro wrapper for GBAx
 This wrapper makes GBAx API compatible with libretro, thus allowing its use
 with libretro frontends, such as RetroArch.
 .
 GBAx is a new emulator for running Game Boy Advance games. It aims to be faster
 and more accurate than many existing Game Boy Advance emulators, as well as
